2d:["$","div","Taxes, TDS and premature withdrawal",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Taxes, TDS and premature withdrawal"}],[["$","p","FD interest is added to your income and taxed at",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"FD interest is added to your income and taxed at your slab rate every year, even for a cumulative FD where you receive nothing until maturity. Banks deduct TDS when the interest in a financial year crosses the threshold set by the Income Tax Department. If your total income is below the taxable limit you can submit Form 15G or 15H to avoid TDS."}],["$","p","Closing an FD early usually reduces the rate by ",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Closing an FD early usually reduces the rate by around 0.5–1 percentage point and some banks charge a penalty. If you may need the money, split one large deposit into a few smaller FDs so you can break only what you need."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Compare the post-tax return, not only the headline rate",{"children":"Compare the post-tax return, not only the headline rate"}],["$","li","DICGC insurance covers up to ₹5 lakh per depositor per bank (principal plus interest)",{"children":"DICGC insurance covers up to ₹5 lakh per depositor per bank (principal plus interest)"}],["$","li","Laddering FDs across tenures balances liquidity and returns",{"children":"Laddering FDs across tenures balances liquidity and returns"}]]}],null]}]
2e:["$","div","Choosing between FD and other options",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Choosing between FD and other options"}],[["$","p","FDs are simple and predictable, which is why the",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"FDs are simple and predictable, which is why they suit emergency funds and short-term goals. For goals beyond five years, inflation can erode returns, so many people mix FDs with equity or debt funds. Use this calculator alongside the SIP and PPF tools to compare options for the same goal."}]],null,null]}]
